          "short": "$3(x+2)^2-9$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3x^2+12x+3&=3(x^2+4x+1)\\\\3x^2+12x+3&=3\\left((x+2)^2-4+1\\right)\\\\3x^2+12x+3&=3(x+2)^2-9.\\end{align*}$$",
