          "short": "$3\\left(x+\\frac12\\right)^2+\\frac14$\n\nFactor out $3$, then complete the square inside the brackets.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3x^2+3x+1&=3\\left(x^2+x+\\frac13\\right)\\\\3x^2+3x+1&=3\\left(\\left(x+\\frac12\\right)^2-\\frac14+\\frac13\\right)\\\\3x^2+3x+1&=3\\left(\\left(x+\\frac12\\right)^2+\\frac1{12}\\right)\\\\3x^2+3x+1&=3\\left(x+\\frac12\\right)^2+\\frac14.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
